<title>USA: Inco Homes completes reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Inco Homes completes reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>UPLAND, Calif 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inco Homes Corp said Monday it had completed a one-for-six reverse split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The builder of single-family homes said it made the split after a January 15 stockholders meeting.</p>
<p>Inco Homes had 8.6 million outstanding common shares in its second quarter ended June 30, compared to 8.1 million for the same period the previous year.</p>
